{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>When you build.</b> This teaches me only one who builds; from where do I derive one who acquires from his fellow or receives as a gift? Scripture says <b>בית</b>, in any case." "<b>And you shall make.</b> If he made it and someone fell, he must forever remake it. And it is placed here to say: after they wage war and come into the land, they begin with the commandments of the house, and afterwards with the commandments of the seed and the planting." "<b>And you shall not put blood on your house.</b> To include anything harmful, such as a bad dog and a rickety ladder."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:53:47.504490825Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}